    {"id": "zht-knee-new", "lang": "zh-Hant", "kind": "memoryFact", "scope": "memory", "priority": 100, "ageDays": 6, "conversation": null,
     "text": "已確認的記憶：換了跑鞋之後左膝一直很安穩，做速度訓練也不再不舒服了。"},
