    {"id": "zht-stress", "lang": "zh-Hant", "kind": "journalNote", "scope": "personalLogs", "priority": 80, "ageDays": 5, "conversation": null,
     "text": "2026-08-14：這週工作壓力極大，肩膀完全僵住，睡眠也感覺得出來。"},
    {"id": "zht-noise1", "lang": "zh-Hant", "kind": "userMessage", "scope": "memory", "priority": 90, "ageDays": 15, "conversation": "zht-c5",
     "text": "我這週的睡眠不太好，你可以看一下嗎？"},
    {"id": "zht-noise2", "lang": "zh-Hant", "kind": "userMessage", "scope": "memory", "priority": 90, "ageDays": 15, "conversation": "zht-c5",
     "text": "睡眠還是不行，總是三點左右醒來。"},
    {"id": "zht-noise3", "lang": "zh-Hant", "kind": "userMessage", "scope": "memory", "priority": 90, "ageDays": 15, "conversation": "zht-c5",
